head_commit.message:
Deduplicate op conversion patterns in MHLO and StableHLO legalization passes

Factor shared type/attribute/region conversion and pattern registration out of per-op conversion templates in `xla/mlir_hlo/mhlo/transforms/stablehlo_legalize_to_hlo/stablehlo_legalize_to_hlo.cc` and `xla/mlir_hlo/mhlo/transforms/hlo_legalize_to_stablehlo/hlo_legalize_to_stablehlo.cc`, shrinking `mlir-hlo-opt` by ~354 KB (`+156/-153` lines).

- Factor op-independent `convertTypesAndAttributes` and `convertRegions` (guarded by `!OpTrait::ZeroRegions`) out of `StablehloToHloOpConverter<StablehloOpTy>`, matching `hlo_legalize_to_stablehlo.cc`.
- Inherit `StablehloToHloOpConverter`, `HloToStablehloOpConverter`, and `HloToStablehloCustomCallOpConverter` directly from `mlir::ConversionPattern` (`OpTy::getOperationName()`) instead of `mlir::OpConversionPattern<OpTy>`, avoiding ~270 per-op `OpConversionPattern` subclasses, `dispatchTo1To1` wrappers, and `OpAdaptor` instantiations since none of these converters read typed properties from `adaptor`.
- Outline pattern-set insertion into a non-template `addPattern(RewritePatternSet*, std::unique_ptr<RewritePattern>)` helper called from a fold expression instead of expanding `RewritePatternSet::addImplForEach` per op, consolidate `getPublicFeaturesNotInStablehlo` via `llvm::is_one_of`, and remove a duplicate unreachable `SubAxisInfoAttr`/`AxisRefAttr` block in `hlo_legalize_to_stablehlo.cc`.
- Bind `ArrayRef<NamedAttribute> attrs = op->getAttrs()` once with upfront `reserve(attrs.size())` in both passes so ODS `Properties` attribute dictionaries are not reconstructed twice per op.

**Before**
```cpp
template <typename OpTy>
class Converter : public OpConversionPattern<OpTy> {
  LogicalResult matchAndRewrite(OpTy op, typename OpTy::Adaptor adaptor,
                                ConversionPatternRewriter& rewriter) const final {
    // Per-op type conversion, op->getAttrs() loop, and region inlining...
  }
};
patterns->add<Converter<OpTypes>...>(*converter, context);
```

**After**
```cpp
template <typename OpTy>
class Converter : public ConversionPattern {
  Converter(TypeConverter& converter, MLIRContext* context)
      : ConversionPattern(converter, OpTy::getOperationName(), 1, context) {}
  LogicalResult matchAndRewrite(Operation* op, ArrayRef<Value> operands,
                                ConversionPatternRewriter& rewriter) const final {
    if (failed(convertTypesAndAttributes(typeConverter, op, types, attrs)))
      return failure();
    // Create target op; call shared convertRegions(...) if !ZeroRegions.
  }
};
(addPattern(patterns, std::make_unique<Converter<OpTypes>>(*converter, context)), ...);
```

**Runtime and memory impact:** Neutral-to-faster pass execution with lower temporary heap churn (`-5.35%` geomean pass wall time across 4 `mlir-hlo-opt --mlir-timing` MHLO/StableHLO legalization workloads, `n=12`, no statistically significant regressions). Eliminating `dispatchTo1To1` / `OpAdaptor` construction per op and evaluating `op->getAttrs()` once with upfront `reserve` avoids redundant `DictionaryAttr` reconstructions and `SmallVector` reallocations.

